WEBVTT

00:01.840 --> 00:03.240
These years

00:03.400 --> 00:05.320
I've been away from the palace long

00:05.400 --> 00:07.400
Mother, thanks to elder brother's company

00:07.840 --> 00:09.000
This pastry

00:09.080 --> 00:10.747
Elder brother should have it

00:20.280 --> 00:22.080
I'll make a few more boxes later

00:22.200 --> 00:23.880
And have them sent to your residence

00:23.960 --> 00:24.760
Of course

00:24.840 --> 00:27.173
The elder one won't be left out

00:30.400 --> 00:31.240
Your son

00:31.320 --> 00:32.720
Thanks Mother

